<title>USA: J.D. Power initial quality rankings by nameplate.</title>
<headline>J.D. Power initial quality rankings by nameplate.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following chart shows defect rates from the 1997 J.D. Power &amp; Associates Initial Quality survey by nameplate.</p>
<p>The combined car and truck scores, released by automakers, show the average number of customer-reported problems per 100 vehicles within the first three months of ownership. J.D. Power, based in Agoura Hills, Calif., surveyed 43,753 owners of 1997 vehicles.</p>
<p>Results are given separately for automakers' brands, such</p>
<p>as Ford Motor Co.'s Ford, Mercury and Lincoln divisions.</p>
<p>RANK/MAKE	1997 problems     1996 problems</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>1.  Infiniti	   55		   66</p>
<p>2.  Lexus		57		   54</p>
<p>3.  Honda		60		   78</p>
<p>4.  Toyota	     64		   80</p>
<p>5.  Mercedes-Benz    66		   83</p>
<p>6.  Volvo		69		   71</p>
<p>7.  Saturn	     73		   82</p>
<p>8.  Nissan	     78		   85</p>
<p>9.  Acura		79		   85</p>
<p>9.  Audi		 79		  106</p>
<p>11. Ford		 80		  115</p>
<p>12. Geo		  81		   92</p>
<p>12. Mercury	    81		  100</p>
<p>14. Buick		82		  104</p>
<p>INDUSTRY AVERAGE     86		  110</p>
<p>15. Jaguar	     88		   90</p>
<p>15. Lincoln	    88		   86</p>
<p>17. BMW		  89		  113</p>
<p>18. Jeep		 92		  134</p>
<p>19. Chevrolet	  93		  125</p>
<p>19. Plymouth	   93		  132</p>
<p>19. Subaru	     93		  108</p>
<p>22. Volkswagen	 95		  126</p>
<p>23. Mazda		98		   85</p>
<p>24. Oldsmobile	101		  101</p>
<p>25. Chrysler	  105		  124</p>
<p>26. GMC		 107		  145</p>
<p>27. Dodge	     109		  125</p>
<p>27. Isuzu	     109		  N/A</p>
<p>29. Cadillac	  110		   95</p>
<p>29. Saab		110		   84</p>
<p>31. Porsche	   111		   89</p>
<p>32. Eagle	     121		  120</p>
<p>33. Mitsubishi	124		  149</p>
<p>34. Hyundai	   128		  146</p>
<p>35. Pontiac	   130		  142</p>
<p>35. Suzuki	    130		  160</p>
<p>37. Land Rover	143		  187</p>
<p>38. Kia		 275		  N/A</p>
<p>SOURCE: Automakers</p>
